# REST Client examples. Start the app and replace identifiers using list responses.
@base = http://localhost:8313
@key =

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health

### Runtime metadata
GET {{base}}/api/meta
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

### Actual route contract
GET {{base}}/api/routes
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

### Recent jobs
GET {{base}}/api/jobs
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

### Metadata-only audit history
GET {{base}}/api/audit
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

### Create a collection
POST {{base}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

< ./examples/collection.json

### Ingest text and await its indexing job
POST {{base}}/api/collections/REPLACE_COLLECTION_ID/documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: example-document-1

{"title":"Identity ownership","text":"Platform Team -> OWNS -> Identity Service\nPlatform Team owns Identity Service and responds to its incidents.","source":"Local example"}

### Query committed indexed documents
POST {{base}}/api/collections/REPLACE_COLLECTION_ID/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}

< ./examples/query.json

### Export the graph
GET {{base}}/api/collections/REPLACE_COLLECTION_ID/graph.graphml
X-Workspace-Key: {{key}}
